;; review4 bug-06: a second defonce of the same name re-runs its init and
;; overwrites the var (silent). driver.lg treats defonce as def (library
;; index! rewrites it to (def ..); the main program the same way). Neither
;; legmacs nor xsofy uses defonce (grep 2026-10-02), so exposure is generic.
;; native lg 4e769212 prints:
;; once-init
;; 1
(defonce once (do (println "once-init") 1))
(defonce once (do (println "second-init") 2))
(println once)
